AI Assistance

The application was designed so that it can run inside GitHub Codespaces and can later be deployed to a production hosting platform.

The application uses:

app.run(
    host="0.0.0.0",
    port=5000
)

This allows Flask to be accessed through the Codespaces forwarded port.

For production deployment, the Flask development server should be replaced with a production WSGI server such as Gunicorn.

