Main Business Rule

The central rule of the application is:

The most pressing ticket should always appear first.

This is achieved by combining deadline/overdue information with priority and creation time rather than simply displaying tickets in database insertion order.

Escalation Rule

The automated escalation system follows:

LOW
 ↓
NORMAL
 ↓
HIGH
 ↓
URGENT

Only one step is allowed per escalation run.

URGENT → URGENT

is the maximum level.

